MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Kai: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Kai_001: Sorry, Mom...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Dit: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Dit_001: Hehehe... Haha... AHAHAHA!
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Seo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Seo_001: Our hatred...will never die...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Led: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Led_001: What was I fighting for?
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Lin: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_05_Lin_001: How? How can this happen?
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_04_Gol: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_04_Gol_001: Ngaaah! How'd I screw everything up?
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_05_Zac: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_05_Zac_001: Me... Beaten by these...weaklings?
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_06_Ven: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_06_Ven_001: My dream... My great dream... I'll be a general\nyet... Damned if I won't...
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_07_Nuz: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_07_Nuz_001: Never did I think...I would be bested...
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_09_Ini: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_09_Ini_001: No... It can't be... My bow made me invincible...
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_09_Kou: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_09_Kou_001: Ngh... Damn it. Magistra Raksha...\nI'm sorry...
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_10_Led: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_10_Led_001: This must be a joke... Me?
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_10_Buc: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_10_Buc_001: Like this? Mortifying...
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_11_Znz: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_11_Znz_001: You... What gives you the right?
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_12_Seo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_12_Seo_001: Have I...failed? No. It's not over yet...
MID_EV_DIE_BD11_12_Seo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_BD11_12_Seo_001: But...the long-held dream of Saramis...
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_13_Har: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_13_Har_001: But we were so close... So close...
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_13_Ger: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_13_Ger_001: N-no. I don't want to go back to jail!
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Cas: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Cas_001: Well... Nope, that's not moving. Guess I pushed it too\nfar this time.
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Cas_Kai: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Cas_Kai_001: You know, Cai... You really turned out great.
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Bel: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC11_14_Bel_001: You took me down... A perfect strike.
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_01_Sem: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_01_Sem_001: Brrghhh...
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Anh: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Anh_001: Th-this isn't the end!
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Sar: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Sar_001: Oh no! Not me!
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Naz: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Naz_001: Remember me! I won't lose next time!
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Dai: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Dai_001: Wha?! I lost?! I can't lose! Nobody can beat me...
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Hal: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC12_03_Hal_001: I can't do it! Someone heeelp, maybe!
MID_EV_DIE_BD12_04_Maj: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_BD12_04_Maj_001: No... The great Majide fails...
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_09_Ale: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_09_Ale_001: Impressive...
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_10_Hri: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_10_Hri_001: So you beat me, eh? I'm impressed.
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_10_Nat: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_10_Nat_001: I'll hand it to you... You beat me at my full strength.
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_12_Ket: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_12_Ket_001: Graaah!
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_14_Conlon: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_14_Conlon_001: Yaaah!
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_14_Zen: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_14_Zen_001: Gurgh... I am sorry...children...
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_15_Anh: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_15_Anh_001: Th-that's impossible! I'm a Mediator. I can't lose...
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_16_Bel: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_16_Bel_001: You took me down... A perfect strike.
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_17_Mar: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_17_Mar_001: Not bad for a human! But I should have expected as\nmuch from the winner of the games.
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_17_MarD: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC12_17_MarD_001: You're skilled. But not skilled enough to defeat me!
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_00_Baa: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_00_Baa_001: I won't forget your face...or that arm...
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC13_01_Hoo: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC13_01_Hoo_001: Well done... Princess Theodora...
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_01_Day: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_01_Day_001: Damn you... How dare you make a mockery of me...
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_04_MysteryMan: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_04_MysteryMan_001: Curse you... But this will not stop me.
MID_EV_RETREAT_BD13_05_Baa: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_BD13_05_Baa_001: Uwaaaagh...
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_07_Baa: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_07_Baa_001: Even if this body is destroyed...my soul will...
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_09_Nuz: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_09_Nuz_001: I have lost...our last refuge...
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_13_Day: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC13_13_Day_001: Captured not once, but twice! What a disgrace.
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC13_13_Kra: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC13_13_Kra_001: I knew it... I knew he'd be nothing but trouble...
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_00_Bjo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_00_Bjo_001: Damn it...
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_01_Bol: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_01_Bol_001: No. This can't be happening!
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_03_Oly: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_03_Oly_001: Your talents do not disappoint. But I'm not\nfinished yet!
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_06_Jas: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_06_Jas_001: Gaah... I was...defeated...
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_09_Lec: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_09_Lec_001: Damn it. You think you can embarrass the Mad Dog?
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_09_Mra: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_09_Mra_001: Well fought. Seems I underestimated you.
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_12_Kai: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_12_Kai_001: Ngh... That didn't go well...
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_12_Buc: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_12_Buc_001: Like this? Mortifying...
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_13_Seo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_13_Seo_001: I can scarcely believe it... That even I should fall\nbefore you...
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_14_Qui: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_14_Qui_001: Urk... Uwah...
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_14_Mra: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_14_Mra_001: Summoning the underworld has drained me. I should\nmake myself scarce.
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_15_Bel: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC14_15_Bel_001: You've got talent. But I'm not done!
