MID_EV_DIE_SC18_17_Shi_001: 
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_00_Kai: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_00_Kai_001: Sorry, Mom... Sorry, Pop. I won't make it home.
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_00_Led: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_00_Led_001: It's not over yet. It can't be!
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Nat: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Nat_001: I'm on the back foot... I think it's time to retreat.
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Hri: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Hri_001: I see. Impressive... You're serious about this war\nagainst the Divine Emperor, hm?
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Jan: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Jan_001: Gah...I had an off day, that's all! This is far from\nmy best!
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Lin: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_00_Lin_001: I may have misjudged you somewhat...
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_01_Hri: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_01_Hri_001: Heh... So, this is where I die.
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_01_Nat: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_01_Nat_001: Damn it... Caught off guard. But I cannot afford\nto fall!
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_01_Nat_002: Don't you go and get yourself killed, Creek.
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_01_Jan: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_01_Jan_001: I'm not running away! This is... It's a strategic\nretreat!
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_01_Lin: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_01_Lin_001: I see that your previous victory was no mere fluke...
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Nat: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Nat_001: King Bertrand... Queen Aswan. I beg you to oversee\nthis country well.
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Nat_002: Is that your face I see, Creek? Oh, stop smiling...\nI gave it all I had.
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Gil: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Gil_001: Damn it... So I lose yet again.
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Gil_002: *cough* I guess my life has finally run its course.
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Gil_003: What? Gilchris... My brother?
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_03_Gil_004: NO! Brother... Wh-what have I done?!
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_05_Tal: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_05_Tal_001: Looks like... I misread the situation... I must\nbe slipping...
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_05_Lin: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_05_Lin_001: So much...for my desire... I'm sorry, Mother...
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_06_Dit: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC30_06_Dit_001: I have found my joy...
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_06_Dag: <TH>
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_06_Dag_001: Gragh... Lowly humans...
MID_EV_RETREAT_SC30_06_Dag_002: Yaaagh! I-impossible... Simply impossible...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_06_Dag: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_06_Dag_001: Uch... You're more capable than you let on...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_06_DagD: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_06_DagD_001: Impossible... There's...no way!
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Znz: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Znz_001: Please, don't take it away... I can't lose my paradise.
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Bol: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Bol_001: Did I...take the wrong path?
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Jan: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Jan_001: This...this isn't the end! Lord Balor, forgive me!
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Dit: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Dit_001: Ah— Ahhh...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Bre: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_07_Bre_001: To think you could surpass me. Hah. Impressive.
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_13_Anh: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_13_Anh_001: Wh...why...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_13_Shi: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_13_Shi_001: Defeat? There can be no defeat. It is unacceptable!
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Bel: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Bel_001: Urgh...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Cir: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Cir_001: I rolled the dice...and got snake eyes.
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Che: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Che_001: It seems it was I who had the rotten luck.
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Ara: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Ara_001: Have I lost? My body, it's crumbling...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Hno: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_08_Hno_001: It can't be... My kingdom crumbles like sand...\ndisintegrates like dust...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Kai: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Kai_001: I'm...I'm falling apart... But I can still fight...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Har: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Har_001: Gervasio, where are you? Gervasio!
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Bou: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Bou_001: No... No, don't melt me down...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Hyo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_11_Hyo_001: No... I haven't lost. I won't lose. Not yet. Not yet!
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Tal: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Tal_001: Damn... That wasn't fun...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Gil: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Gil_001: Stepmother... Stepmother, where are you?
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Ban: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Ban_001: Why...must you stand in my way?
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Baa: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Baa_001: Aagh... Oogh...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Dra: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_09_Dra_001: You...beat me? No... You couldn't possibly!
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_10_Seo: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_10_Seo_001: Do not forget...our long-held hatred... It will never,\never fade...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_10_Day: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_10_Day_001: Stop... Please, stop... Don't kill me... Not again...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_10_Mhm: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_10_Mhm_001: Ngh... Im...impressive!
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Led: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Led_001: So I must leave unsatisfied?!
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Mra: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Mra_001: You insolent fool. Always getting in my way...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Mra_002: Good night...Mom...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Mra_003: Father... I...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Man: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Man_001: Ugh...gh...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Qui: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Qui_001: I remember nothing...not even who I am.
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Lec: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Lec_001: Argh... Ugh... Wha— Urgh...
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Coh: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_12_Coh_001: I've been routed...by them?
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_14_Lyr: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_14_Lyr_001: I could not stop them. Forgive me, Father.
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_15_Bal: <TH>
MID_EV_DIE_SC00_15_Bal_001: Rrgh... For this to happen to me? To Balor, king of\nthe underworld?
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Kai: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Kai_001: Died trying to save Pop... Mom's gonna kill me...
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Dit: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Dit_001: So this is how it ends...
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Dit_002: Dietrich! I'm sorry...I screwed it up!
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Seo: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Seo_001: It seems I miscalculated...
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Seo_002: Theodora! I'm sorry...I screwed it up!
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Led: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Led_001: This can't be happening.
MID_DIE_SCXX_00_Led_002: Leda! I'm sorry...I screwed it up!
