MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Dit: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Dit_001: And so the dance ends.
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Kai: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Kai_001: No... I can still...
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Kai_002: Cai...
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Seo: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Seo_001: It seems I miscalculated...
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Seo_002: Theodora...
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Led: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Led_001: This can't be happening.
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Led_002: Leda...
