MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Orh_001: 
MID_DIE_SCXX_01_Orh_002: 
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Seo: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Seo_001: My strength...my resolve... They were insufficient\nfor the brave warrior...
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Kai: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Kai_001: No... I can still...
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Kai_002: Cai! Forgive me...
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Dit: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Dit_001: So this is how it ends...
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Dit_002: Dietrich! Forgive me...
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Led: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Led_001: This can't be happening.
MID_DIE_SCXX_02_Led_002: Leda! Forgive me...
