MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Kai: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Kai_001: B-but...Grandma's ring...
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Kai_002: Grandma? W-wait, are you my...
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Dit: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Dit_001: So this is how it ends...
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Dit_002: Dietrich—no! This is all my fault...
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Seo: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Seo_001: A thousand pardons, Yu Phas... And Orchel as well...
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Seo_002: Theodora—no! There's nothing to apologize for...
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Led: <TH>
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Led_001: This can't be happening.
MID_DIE_SCXX_06_Led_002: Leda—no! This is all my fault...
