MID_DIE_SCXX_Termination: <TEDF>
MID_DIE_Kai0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Kai0_01: Never thought it'd end here—like this...
MID_RETREAT_Kai0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Kai0_01: I think I'd better pull back.
MID_DIE_Kai1: <TH>
MID_DIE_Kai1_01: Sorry, Mom.
MID_RETREAT_Kai1: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Kai1_01: I think I overdid it. Gonna step back.
MID_DIE_Tia0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Tia0_01: Grandpa, I'm sorry...but I can't go on...
MID_RETREAT_Tia0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Tia0_01: Sorry. I think I need a break.
MID_DIE_Tia1: <TH>
MID_DIE_Tia1_01: Everyone, I'm sorry, but...I can't go on...
MID_RETREAT_Tia1: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Tia1_01: Sorry, but let me take a break.
MID_DIE_Pet0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Pet0_01: Mom, it's so dark... Mom...
MID_RETREAT_Pet0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Pet0_01: It's too much! I'm heading home!
MID_DIE_Pet1: <TH>
MID_DIE_Pet1_01: I tried, Tialla...
MID_RETREAT_Pet1: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Pet1_01: Sorry, guys. I have to step back!
MID_DIE_Hur0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Hur0_01: Noah, Cezarie... I'm sorry. Your big sister's not\ncoming home.
MID_RETREAT_Hur0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Hur0_01: I think it's time I step back.
MID_DIE_Hur1: <TH>
MID_DIE_Hur1_01: If this means a better future, then it's worth it.
MID_DIE_Bel0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Bel0_01: I am sorry, Aswan...
MID_RETREAT_Bel0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Bel0_01: I cannot fall. I have to survive and return to Aswan.
MID_DIE_Bel1: <TH>
MID_DIE_Bel1_01: So, this is the end, eh? I leave the rest to you.
MID_RETREAT_Bel1: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Bel1_01: No point in continuing. I'll make my retreat.
MID_DIE_Bel2: <TH>
MID_DIE_Bel2_01: No—impossible.
MID_RETREAT_Bel2: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Bel2_01: I've been badly wounded. I think I'd best retreat.
MID_DIE_Gat0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Gat0_01: So...I have failed in my duties.
MID_RETREAT_Gat0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Gat0_01: I still have a mission I must complete.
MID_DIE_Max0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Max0_01: In the end, I wasn't any help... Guess I was always\ngoing to be...a nobody.
MID_RETREAT_Max0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Max0_01: Sorry—I have to head back.
MID_DIE_Gol0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Gol0_01: Eh, it's alright... No one's gonna cry over me.
MID_RETREAT_Gol0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Gol0_01: Damn it! My body's not doing what I tell it to.
MID_DIE_Dan0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Dan0_01: Fascinating... The blood, it won't stop. It's like a\nfield of crimson flowers...
MID_RETREAT_Dan0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Dan0_01: Zounds... I've been hurt too badly. I'm loath\nto retreat, but I must.
MID_DIE_Dit0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Dit0_01: I have found the joy I sought.
MID_RETREAT_Dit0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Dit0_01: You have bested me...this time.
MID_DIE_Dit1: <TH>
MID_DIE_Dit1_01: To die after exhausting my strength... There is\nbeauty in this.
MID_DIE_Fab0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Fab0_01: My long journey has reached its end. And indeed, it\nwas long. So long...
MID_RETREAT_Fab0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Fab0_01: To think I would be brought so low... But this\nhumiliation...has savor!
MID_DIE_Fab1: <TH>
MID_DIE_Fab1_01: The irony of it... After I had finally found something\nto hold dear.
MID_RETREAT_Fab1: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Fab1_01: It seems I am at my limit. I shall fall back.
MID_DIE_Esm0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Esm0_01: Is it the end for me? Here? Now?
MID_RETREAT_Esm0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Esm0_01: This isn't good. I need to get out of here. Sorry!
MID_DIE_Mic0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Mic0_01: After all this, it's over? I can't believe it...
MID_RETREAT_Mic0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Mic0_01: This isn't the end for me. I have a lot left to do!
MID_DIE_Orh0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Orh0_01: Credna... Thank you for everything...
MID_RETREAT_Orh0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Orh0_01: Impairments to sections... Risk of compromise...\nOh! Sorry, I'll need to step out...
MID_DIE_Orh1: <TH>
MID_DIE_Orh1_01: Progenitor god... I return to you, at last...
MID_RETREAT_Orh1: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Orh1_01: Oh, Elizabeth... I fear that I push you to the limit\ntoo often. I will retreat...
MID_DIE_Die0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Die0_01: Looks like...that's it... Take good care, Orchel...
MID_RETREAT_Die0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Die0_01: I can't fight anymore? Can I? Oh, damn it...
MID_DIE_Die1: <TH>
MID_DIE_Die1_01: I wonder where...I'll be going...
MID_DIE_Lor0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Lor0_01: What the— But I'm barely hurt...
MID_RETREAT_Lor0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Lor0_01: That hurt too much! I'm outta here...
MID_DIE_Lor1: <TH>
MID_DIE_Lor1_01: What the— But I'm barely hurt...
MID_RETREAT_Lor1: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Lor1_01: That hurt too much! I'm outta here...
MID_DIE_Set0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Set0_01: I can't die here... What about Flayn...
MID_RETREAT_Set0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Set0_01: Impossible... To think that I could suffer\ninjury like this...
MID_DIE_Nin0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Nin0_01: Oh, there it is... A light... A bright light...
MID_RETREAT_Nin0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Nin0_01: I wasn't...strong enough... Very, very troubling...
MID_DIE_Seo0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Seo0_01: This can't be... How could I fail?
MID_RETREAT_Seo0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Seo0_01: I have perhaps overextended myself... I shall rest...
MID_DIE_Seo1: <TH>
MID_DIE_Seo1_01: Saving all who live...seems to have been beyond\nwhat I could achieve...
MID_DIE_Seo2: <TH>
MID_DIE_Seo2_01: Not yet... My journey has only...just begun...
MID_DIE_Bon0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Bon0_01: This is it...my end...
MID_RETREAT_Bon0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Bon0_01: No... I have too much to do to die yet...
MID_DIE_Tob0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Tob0_01: Bona... Our day is over... It's up to the kids now...
MID_RETREAT_Tob0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Tob0_01: Oww, my back! I can't stand. I've gotta retreat!
MID_DIE_Lil0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Lil0_01: I just...wanted things like...how they were before...
MID_RETREAT_Lil0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Lil0_01: Uh...feels like this is more than they're paying me\nfor. I'm gonna withdraw.
MID_DIE_Lys0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Lys0_01: But I...haven't made a name for myself yet...
MID_RETREAT_Lys0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Lys0_01: I can't afford to die here... I must retreat.
MID_DIE_Tal0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Tal0_01: I've lived long enough...to get bored of it all... If this\nis it...that's not so bad...
MID_RETREAT_Tal0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Tal0_01: Damn... How could I have read this so wrong?\nWhat a mess...
MID_DIE_Tal1: <TH>
MID_DIE_Tal1_01: So...this is what...the end of the road looks like, huh?\nWell...what a road it was...
MID_DIE_Urs0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Urs0_01: No, I... I wanted so much more from life... Please...\njust a little more time...
MID_RETREAT_Urs0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Urs0_01: I can't win here... I have to retreat for now...
MID_DIE_Lou0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Lou0_01: No... It can't end like this, can it? But...but, I...
MID_RETREAT_Lou0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Lou0_01: I'm sorry! I have to get out of here...
MID_DIE_Sim0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Sim0_01: Well... I guess life was fun...in its own way...
MID_RETREAT_Sim0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Sim0_01: Damn it, I'm only getting in the way like this... Sorry\nif I let you down...
MID_DIE_Fia0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Fia0_01: No... I don't want to die... Talimun...where are you?
MID_RETREAT_Fia0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Fia0_01: I can't die... Not here...
MID_DIE_Led0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Led0_01: Father? It's me, Leilidahna... How I missed you...
MID_RETREAT_Led0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Led0_01: I'm sorry, but I can't die. Not until I kill him.
MID_RETREAT_Led1: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Led1_01: I need to recover... But don't worry. I'll see you again\nin time.
MID_DIE_Buc0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Buc0_01: Lord Guillermo... It seems the time has come for me\nto return to your side.
MID_RETREAT_Buc0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Buc0_01: I cannot break my vow... I will withdraw.
MID_DIE_Sci0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Sci0_01: Heh... I'd always thought I'd die in a woman's\narms... Seems that was not meant to be.
MID_RETREAT_Sci0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Sci0_01: I suppose I'm not in my best form. My next battles\nwill not go so poorly.
MID_DIE_Oly0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Oly0_01: Fated to scatter my petals, I see. I leave without\nregrets.
MID_RETREAT_Oly0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Oly0_01: I will not be defeated again. Mark my words!
MID_DIE_Moo0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Moo0_01: That's weird... This wasn't supposed to happen.
MID_RETREAT_Moo0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Moo0_01: I'm sorry... I slowed you down.
MID_DIE_Moo1: <TH>
MID_DIE_Moo1_01: Why? I can't go... I need to keep fighting...
MID_RETREAT_Moo1: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Moo1_01: I'm sorry... I slowed you down.
MID_DIE_Anh0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Anh0_01: No... I can't, not yet! I haven't completed\nmy mission...
MID_RETREAT_Anh0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Anh0_01: I... I cannot fall here. I cannot!
MID_DIE_Anh1: <TH>
MID_DIE_Anh1_01: I can't go on... Please, keep fighting...for the sake of\nthe future...
MID_DIE_Naz0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Naz0_01: If I'm not the strongest...then what's the point\nin my existence?
MID_RETREAT_Naz0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Naz0_01: There's some seriously strong people in this world...
MID_DIE_Sar0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Sar0_01: I'm so sorry. Please, everyone, stay safe.
MID_RETREAT_Sar0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Sar0_01: I can't push myself so hard. I'm sorry, but I need\nto retreat for a bit...
MID_DIE_Dai0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Dai0_01: Aw, I couldn't save everyone... I'm sorry...
MID_RETREAT_Dai0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Dai0_01: I'm not doing so good! I'm gonna go recover and\ncome back later!
MID_DIE_Hal0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Hal0_01: All I ever wanted was to be just a little bit\nhappier, maybe...
MID_RETREAT_Hal0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Hal0_01: I can't fight anymore. I gotta run away, quick.
MID_DIE_Ism0M: <TH>
MID_DIE_Ism0M_01: I can't fall...before my path runs its course...\nBut my strength fails me...
MID_RETREAT_Ism0M: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Ism0M_01: I'm sorry...but I don't think I can fight anymore...
MID_DIE_Ism0F: <TH>
MID_DIE_Ism0F_01: I can't fall...before my path runs its course...\nBut my strength fails me...
MID_RETREAT_Ism0F: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Ism0F_01: I'm sorry...but I don't think I can fight anymore...
MID_DIE_Kou0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Kou0_01: Ah... Britannis... How I wish I could...go to you...
MID_RETREAT_Kou0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Kou0_01: I haven't yet fully atoned...so I must live on...
MID_DIE_Tro0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Tro0_01: Hahaha... I lived well...with many joys... I have...\nno...regrets...
MID_RETREAT_Tro0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Tro0_01: Ugh, my body isn't what it once was. I'm falling back.
MID_DIE_Sol0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Sol0_01: Unbelievable...that even I could know defeat...
MID_RETREAT_Sol0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Sol0_01: My apologies, but...you'll have to win this\nwithout me.
MID_DIE_Fot0: 
MID_DIE_Fot0_01: 
MID_RETREAT_Fot0: 
MID_RETREAT_Fot0_01: 
MID_DIE_Dag0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Dag0_01: I will...never fall...
MID_RETREAT_Dag0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Dag0_01: This is a truly unfortunate day.
MID_DIE_Bal0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Bal0_01: How?! How could I...be defeated?
MID_RETREAT_Bal0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Bal0_01: I will never be gone... Not until this resentment...\nis sated...
MID_DIE_Lyr0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Lyr0_01: Father... I'm coming to you.
MID_RETREAT_Lyr0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Lyr0_01: Ngh... You...surpassed me?
MID_DIE_Ish0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Ish0_01: My whole life, not one good thing. Not one!
MID_RETREAT_Ish0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Ish0_01: You'll live for now.
MID_DIE_Mna0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Mna0_01: No... I have more to do...
MID_RETREAT_Mna0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Mna0_01: I acted rashly.
MID_DIE_Jun0: 
MID_DIE_Jun0_01: 
MID_RETREAT_Jun0: 
MID_RETREAT_Jun0_01: 
MID_DIE_Mar0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Mar0_01: You defeated me? Excellent.
MID_RETREAT_Mar0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Mar0_01: You're better than I expected.
MID_DIE_Smi0: 
MID_DIE_Smi0_01: 
MID_RETREAT_Smi0: 
MID_RETREAT_Smi0_01: 
MID_DIE_Cla0: 
MID_DIE_Cla0_01: 
MID_RETREAT_Cla0: 
MID_RETREAT_Cla0_01: 
MID_DIE_Car0: 
MID_DIE_Car0_01: 
MID_RETREAT_Car0: 
MID_RETREAT_Car0_01: 
MID_DIE_Aur0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Aur0_01: Father, Mother... I'll see you someday.
MID_RETREAT_Aur0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Aur0_01: This is dreadful—I'm afraid I must withdraw.
MID_DIE_Guj0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Guj0_01: So...Undying Guzran dies here? An interesting\nlife...to the end...
MID_RETREAT_Guj0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Guj0_01: I really prefer not dying... So I'll do that.
MID_DIE_Yan0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Yan0_01: I will go nameless...on my tomb... Write only...\n"He slew...many a bottle..."
MID_RETREAT_Yan0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Yan0_01: I am defeated... Then I must withdraw...
MID_DIE_Iio0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Iio0_01: It's going dark... Where are you, Father... I need to\nfeed Rocinan...
MID_RETREAT_Iio0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Iio0_01: I can't fulfill my contract if I'm dead... I must retreat.
MID_DIE_Pep0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Pep0_01: To meet our end on foreign soil... Well, we have\nno regrets...
MID_RETREAT_Pep0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Pep0_01: You, get the better of us? Your reward will be only\nour retreat.
MID_DIE_Noc0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Noc0_01: My fists...took me only so far...
MID_RETREAT_Noc0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Noc0_01: I'm no match as I am, I guess... I hate having to\nretreat, but here I go...
MID_DIE_Sop0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Sop0_01: All my strength...gone... Maybe if I...eat...
MID_RETREAT_Sop0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Sop0_01: Th-that's all I can do. I'm backing out and can't\nwait to have a decent meal.
MID_DIE_Cat0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Cat0_01: Is this...the end? Why was life so...ridiculous...
MID_RETREAT_Cat0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Cat0_01: I might have rushed in too fast. Though I dislike\nretreating, that's the best action.
MID_DIE_Ned0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Ned0_01: That's...what it all comes to? But no regrets...\nHere in battle, I die...with pride...
MID_RETREAT_Ned0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Ned0_01: Sorry, but that's as far as I go. I've got to leave the\nrest in your hands.
MID_DIE_Zac0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Zac0_01: Damn it all... What a wretched life...
MID_RETREAT_Zac0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Zac0_01: I joined up to kill...not be killed... Only good move\nhere is gettin' out...
MID_DIE_Maj0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Maj0_01: The great Majide...dies here? No, never...\nI can still...still...
MID_RETREAT_Maj0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Maj0_01: Hey, this guy does NOT die today. I'm\ngonna scram...
MID_DIE_Ven0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Ven0_01: Am I going...to die? I don't want to... There's more\nfor me... The world's greatest...general...
MID_RETREAT_Ven0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Ven0_01: Enough of that... N-now to bow out... All in the\nplan, a strategic retreat!
MID_DIE_Ini0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Ini0_01: Ach, Mom, Dad... No comin' home to the whole\nbuncha ya now... Sorry for everything...
MID_RETREAT_Ini0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Ini0_01: I won't be of...any more help here... Apologies,\nbut I need to step out...
MID_DIE_Jas0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Jas0_01: It's sad... Not doing what I needed to... But maybe\nI did...in the end.
MID_RETREAT_Jas0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Jas0_01: It's not time yet...to be reunited with him...\nI can't keep on like this.
MID_DIE_Ale0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Ale0_01: Ah, Father, Mother... Your little Alexandra...\nfought the best she could...
MID_RETREAT_Ale0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Ale0_01: I can't take any more of this... I'm so sorry, but I\nmust retreat.
MID_DIE_Cen0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Cen0_01: I'm sorry, Aurora.
MID_RETREAT_Cen0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Cen0_01: Ngh... I must retreat. Forgive me!
MID_DIE_Asw0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Asw0_01: My eyes have gone misty... I'm so sorry, Bertrand.
MID_RETREAT_Asw0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Asw0_01: I refuse to be a burden. I will take my leave.
MID_DIE_Cle0: 
MID_DIE_Cle0_01: 
MID_RETREAT_Cle0: 
MID_RETREAT_Cle0_01: 
MID_DIE_Mys0: 
MID_DIE_Mys0_01: 
MID_RETREAT_Mys0: 
MID_RETREAT_Mys0_01: 
MID_DIE_Nat0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Nat0_01: So, Catoblepas falls here... Heh... What would\nCreek say, I wonder.
MID_RETREAT_Nat0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Nat0_01: Rrgh... Got a little hotheaded. Bad habits...\nI'll retreat now.
MID_DIE_Hri0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Hri0_01: The Pantere is put down. If there's a next life,\nNathan, I hope I can spend it with you.
MID_RETREAT_Hri0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Hri0_01: This foe's more formidable than expected. I'd\nbetter go.
MID_DIE_Kir0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Kir0_01: Now I'll join 'em... All the ghosts... Can't get\naway... It's all a bad joke...
MID_RETREAT_Kir0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Kir0_01: If I die, I'd be stuck with the ghosts, wouldn't I?\nWell, no way! I'm outta here!
MID_RETREAT_Kir1: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Kir1_01: Urgh... Damn it all! And I drank that\nflamma too...
MID_DIE_Nuz0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Nuz0_01: I end here, do I? May my soul...find peace...
MID_RETREAT_Nuz0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Nuz0_01: We Har Hali are resilient. So long as we live, we may\nfight another day...
MID_DIE_Ann0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Ann0_01: Lord Solel... Will I still have a place at your side?
MID_RETREAT_Ann0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Ann0_01: Oof! Better retreat while I still can. But mark my\nwords—you'll pay for this!
MID_DIE_Gra0: 
MID_DIE_Gra0_01: 
MID_RETREAT_Gra0: 
MID_RETREAT_Gra0_01: 
MID_DIE_Cas0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Cas0_01: Here? Now? Cai, Aurora... Live well.
MID_RETREAT_Cas0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Cas0_01: I messed up. Sorry—you'll have to take it from here.
MID_DIE_Tah0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Tah0_01: Aswan, I've failed you.
MID_RETREAT_Tah0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Tah0_01: Ah... Harder than I expected. I didn't see\nthat coming.
MID_DIE_Nom0: 
MID_DIE_Nom0_01: 
MID_RETREAT_Nom0: 
MID_RETREAT_Nom0_01: 
MID_DIE_Kra0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Kra0_01: So I die on foreign soil... Farewell...warriors of the\nland of Dagda...
MID_RETREAT_Kra0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Kra0_01: Nothing for it but to retreat... My apologies for not\nliving up to my end of the deal.
MID_DIE_Lon0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Lon0_01: Everyone... You must live on...
MID_RETREAT_Lon0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Lon0_01: I was too reckless. Everyone, fight carefully!
MID_DIE_Qui0: 
MID_DIE_Qui0_01: 
MID_RETREAT_Qui0: 
MID_RETREAT_Qui0_01: 
MID_DIE_Cir0: 
MID_DIE_Cir0_01: 
MID_RETREAT_Cir0: 
MID_RETREAT_Cir0_01: 
MID_DIE_Che0: 
MID_DIE_Che0_01: 
MID_RETREAT_Che0: 
MID_RETREAT_Che0_01: 
MID_DIE_Shi0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Shi0_01: How can this be? Weren't we the brightest stars...\nsuperior in all ways?
MID_RETREAT_Shi0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Shi0_01: Rrgh! This isn't the end. I will complete my\nmission...without fail!
MID_DIE_Hyo0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Hyo0_01: Why, why, why... Why is it always like this?
MID_RETREAT_Hyo0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Hyo0_01: You've done it now. But I'm not gonna go down!
MID_DIE_Gan0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Gan0_01: I have not a single regret... My lady...
MID_RETREAT_Gan0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Gan0_01: Rrgh... As shameful as it is... I can only retreat.
MID_DIE_Gil0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Gil0_01: This painful death... Maybe it's my punishment for\nwhat I did to you two.
MID_RETREAT_Gil0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Gil0_01: Damn it. You force me, a king, to retreat?\nUnforgivable!
MID_DIE_Zen0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Zen0_01: My life may end here...but you must chart a course to\nthe future.
MID_RETREAT_Zen0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Zen0_01: Retreating is shameful... What sort of captain am I?
MID_DIE_Sua0: 
MID_DIE_Sua0_01: 
MID_RETREAT_Sua0: 
MID_RETREAT_Sua0_01: 
MID_DIE_Znz0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Znz0_01: Absurd. This is MY world. Mine...
MID_RETREAT_Znz0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Znz0_01: Now, I will set you free...but you will return to\nmy paradise!
MID_DIE_Har0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Har0_01: Gervasio, I let you down. I'm sorry, Brother.
MID_RETREAT_Har0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Har0_01: Caught with the treasure in arm's reach... I've\nmessed it up.
MID_DIE_Ger0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Ger0_01: If only I'd had more money...
MID_RETREAT_Ger0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Ger0_01: Sorry, Brother. Looks like it's back to the clink.
MID_DIE_Kar0: 
MID_DIE_Kar0_01: 
MID_RETREAT_Kar0: 
MID_RETREAT_Kar0_01: 
MID_DIE_Bou0: 
MID_DIE_Bou0_01: 
MID_RETREAT_Bou0: 
MID_RETREAT_Bou0_01: 
MID_DIE_Day0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Day0_01: It hurts... This pain is more than I can take... Help\nme, my dear sister... Please...
MID_RETREAT_Day0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Day0_01: It...it can't be... My plan was flawless!
MID_DIE_Hoo0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Hoo0_01: I spent my life...battling in loyal service... I regret\nnone of it...
MID_RETREAT_Hoo0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Hoo0_01: My apologies, Prince Dyan...this is as far as I go.\nI wish you luck in this battle...
MID_DIE_Baa0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Baa0_01: So I, too, am summoned to Balor's underworld...
MID_RETREAT_Baa0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Baa0_01: I...failed? What uncanny power is it you wield?
MID_DIE_Baa1: <TH>
MID_DIE_Baa1_01: Mine... It belongs to me... My power... My body...
MID_RETREAT_Baa1: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Baa1_01: Bah... I expect no less of the warrior who defeated\nme... But your victory will be short-lived.
MID_DIE_Bjo0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Bjo0_01: Just wanted more gold...
MID_RETREAT_Bjo0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Bjo0_01: Bjor the Magnificent has lost?
MID_DIE_Bol0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Bol0_01: I know I'm to blame... Just let me sleep.
MID_RETREAT_Bol0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Bol0_01: But...I have one of Drake's treasures...
MID_DIE_Lec0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Lec0_01: I killed, and was killed myself—then resurrected.\nOnly to be killed again! Hehe... Hehehe!
MID_RETREAT_Lec0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Lec0_01: How dare you force the Mad Dog to retreat!
MID_DIE_Mad0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Mad0_01: I have repeated my worst mistake... Forgive me.
MID_RETREAT_Mad0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Mad0_01: Rrgh... You're too strong. I'll have to retreat.
MID_DIE_Lin0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Lin0_01: Dragged out from darkness...only to become a corpse.\nFarewell...Mother...
MID_RETREAT_Lin0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Lin0_01: Our losses are too severe... I must retreat for now.
MID_DIE_Ban0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Ban0_01: Rest at last... The Swashbuckler King's journey\nhas come to an end...
MID_RETREAT_Ban0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Ban0_01: Ahhh... That woman... Even in death, my hatred\nfor her burns...
MID_DIE_Jan0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Jan0_01: Argh... This...this isn't how it was supposed to go...
MID_RETREAT_Jan0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Jan0_01: Gah! Retreat! My life's too valuable to lose!
MID_DIE_Hno0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Hno0_01: I am the true king, and you have the temerity to\nturn your blades on ME?
MID_RETREAT_Hno0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Hno0_01: A true king bends, but he does not break. I will\nretreat, and return stronger!
MID_DIE_Dra0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Dra0_01: Is this a joke? Are they really taking MY life?!
MID_RETREAT_Dra0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Dra0_01: Curse you! Next time I see you, your life and treasure\nare mine!
MID_DIE_Mhm0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Mhm0_01: Your strength, in the end, was mightier than\nour wrath...
MID_RETREAT_Mhm0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Mhm0_01: I've no choice but to retreat... But our wrath will\nnever subside.
MID_DIE_Coh0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Coh0_01: I apologize for failing you, Mother!
MID_RETREAT_Coh0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Coh0_01: I must retreat. The women can all see this!
MID_DIE_Bre0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Bre0_01: Heh heh heh... Who knew I could find fulfillment\nafter death?
MID_RETREAT_Bre0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Bre0_01: I'm not satisfied yet... We'll meet again, warriors.
MID_DIE_Jes2: <TH>
MID_DIE_Jes2_01: But there's a place I gotta get back to...
MID_RETREAT_Jes2: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Jes2_01: Heh heh HEH!
MID_DIE_Win0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Win0_01: Despite my efforts...all collapses...
MID_RETREAT_Win0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Win0_01: It seems I must retreat... In my stead, allow none of\nthese fools to survive!
MID_DIE_Ket0: <TH>
MID_DIE_Ket0_01: All this time I have spent... My journey is at its end.
MID_RETREAT_Ket0: <TH>
MID_RETREAT_Ket0_01: Rrgh... Release...